{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And He spoke.</b> Scripture says, \"and the people believed\" (above, v. 31), and not all the people — and everyone acknowledges Elohim, even Pharaoh, as I shall yet explain. Therefore He said, \"and He said to him, I am YHWH\"; therefore say to the children of Israel, I am YHWH (v. 6); \"and you shall know that I am YHWH your Elohim who brought you out\" (v. 7):"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:02.885285516Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}